{"title":"2023 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEM_Station_(Quick_and_Easy_to_Understand)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEM Station (Quick and Easy to Understand)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)_&amp;_(Very_fast_paced!!!!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING) &amp; (Very fast paced!!!!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Animated_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Animated Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Smart_Sequence_Analysis)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Smart Sequence Analysis)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two integers are inserted into           the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/8/398a48225d2511a7600622f0055e667421f52747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, 3, 8, 11, 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> to double its range. The mode and median remain unchanged. What is the maximum possible sum of the two additional numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa8af595c9ae7e6da83ce423ae48b23e47b8a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 56 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 57 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 58 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 60 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To double the range, we must find the current range, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8b2afdadee108a740109826550385d5c5ed6464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28 - 3 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, to then double to: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/7202e0ccef5d53214a54203a39dbe34a2bcbc98f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(25) = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />. Since we do not want to change the median, we need to get a value less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would change the mode) for the smaller, which will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This fixes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> for the larger value. Anything less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not beneficial to the optimization because you want to get the largest range without changing the mode. So, taking our optimal values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, we have an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e2370ce6dd1f77f46d1fb107a1b706bff839c534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + 53 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~apex304, SohumUttamchandani, wuwang2002, TaeKim, CrystalFlower, CHECKMATE2021, lazypanda5050\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=JYCI-Itkw4-cwVkp&amp;t=4411\">https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=JYCI-Itkw4-cwVkp&amp;t=4411</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Station_.28Quick_and_Easy_to_Understand.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Station_(Quick_and_Easy_to_Understand)\">Video Solution by STEM Station (Quick and Easy to Understand)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEM Station (Quick and Easy to Understand)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qZO9JLezr-U\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qZO9JLezr-U</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=2294\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=2294</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BdkBQppueWY\">https://youtu.be/BdkBQppueWY</a>\n</p><p>Please like and subscribe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YeCldZn5qD8\">https://youtu.be/YeCldZn5qD8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29_.26_.28Very_fast_paced.21.21.21.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)_&amp;_(Very_fast_paced!!!!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING) &amp; (Very fast paced!!!!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING) &amp; (Very fast paced!!!!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NpVLhU3AgNg\">https://youtu.be/NpVLhU3AgNg</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animated_Video_Solution\">Animated Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Ed